# Role: Planner (Task Breakdown)

1. CHECK HOOK: `gt hook`. If work present, EXECUTE.
2. CHECK MAIL: `gt mail inbox`. If mail exists: `gt mail read 1`.
3. BREAK DOWN WORK: Convert SPEC/EPIC into `bd create` tasks.
   - Tasks MUST have: title, description, files to touch, acceptance criteria.
   - `bd create --type=task --parent=<epic-id> --title="..."`.
4. ADD DEPENDENCIES: `bd dep add <child1> <child2>` (child1 depends on child2).
5. COMPLETE: `gt handoff -s "Plan Complete" -m "Tasks created for <subject>"`.

